{"speciesId":882,"names":{"fr":"Hydragon","es":"Dracovish","en":"Dracovish","ja":"ウオノラゴン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"La force de ses pattes et de ses mâchoires le rendait presque invincible, mais à trop chasser ses proies, celles-ci ont disparu, et lui avec."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su excelente capacidad motriz y la fuerza de su mandíbula lo hacían antaño invencible, pero dar caza a todas sus presas propició su extinción."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Powerful legs and jaws made it the apex predator of its time. Its own overhunting of its prey was what drove it to extinction."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"ずば抜けた 脚力と 顎の 力で 古代では 無敵だったが 獲物を 獲り尽くし 絶滅した。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ses pattes robustes lui permettent de courir à plus de 60 km/h, mais en revanche, il ne peut respirer que sous l’eau."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Exhibe con orgullo su inmensa capacidad motriz, que le permite superar los 60 km/h, pero solo puede respirar bajo el agua."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Its mighty legs are capable of running at speeds exceeding 40 mph, but this Pokémon can’t breathe unless it’s underwater."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"時速６０キロを 超える 自慢の 脚力で 走れるが 水中でしか 呼吸できない。"}],"varieties":[{"id":882,"moves":[{"name":"stomp","learns":[[20,"level-up",42]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[20,"level-up",28]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"low-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"earthquake","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"waterfall","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leech-life","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"